  "limitations": [
    "This is development evidence, not installed-toolchain promotion, a release gate, or completion of the compiler/library goal.",
    "The full admission owner now includes 24 existing ingress cases and 14 Project 4 cases with eight constructed products. That full construction/default selection and isolated cold double-build qualification were not run. The broad change-aware plan was disproportionate (6735 expected seconds); only causal focused checks ran.",
    "The native reader WVB identity is f80225c3924eadf412f040e6e25912d4f5ff15b70376f1f5a3db12386af7d5cb (40574 bytes). Both hosted native reader products derive from that Windows-produced WVB; independent compiler-source reconstruction on Linux is not claimed.",
    "The focused selection receives retained products explicitly. Installed product discovery, maintained package Project 4 manifests, target-descriptor distribution, and complete project build cache identity remain unfinished.",
    "Source-ordering evidence covers the English profile and the selected three-source closure only. Localized profiles, additional aliases and hostile root substitution, malformed reader inventory, and other target configurations require further coverage before broader claims.",
    "The pre-existing build-driver source explicitly rejects Project 4 to prevent descriptorless fallback, but that oversized driver was not reconstructed or executed from current source. Its current-source guard has review evidence only.",
    "Consumer WVBs are inspected before test cleanup. Their identical hash matches previously verified text-borrow WVB; this record does not claim new native consumer execution.",
    "The native report uses delimiter concatenation only for already validated ASCII paths/digests, which cannot contain JSON escape characters. A prior Text_quote rendering path crashed; its general native/runtime cause remains unresolved and is not qualified by these passes.",
    "The separate Project4-Manifest-Self-Test fixture has earlier direct native execution evidence but is not part of the 14-case admission selection. No complete parser or Project 4 qualification is inferred."
  ],
